Local modification: cross-skill links were rewritten from `./remotion-*/`
to `../remotion-*/`. Upstream nests these skills under one parent
directory and writes the links relative to that parent; here each skill is
a sibling under skills/, so the extra level is required for the links to
resolve. This is the only change from upstream — re-apply it after any sync.

To refresh all Remotion skills from upstream, run the sync workflow
(.github/workflows/sync-vendored-skills.yml) or:

  git clone --depth=1 --filter=blob:none --sparse \
    https://github.com/remotion-dev/remotion.git /tmp/remotion-sparse
  git -C /tmp/remotion-sparse sparse-checkout set packages/skills/skills
  for s in /tmp/remotion-sparse/packages/skills/skills/*/; do
    rm -rf "skills/$(basename "$s")"
    cp -R "$s" "skills/$(basename "$s")"
  done
  sed -i '' 's#](\./remotion-#](../remotion-#g' skills/remotion-*/SKILL.md
  git -C /tmp/remotion-sparse rev-parse HEAD   # update "Vendored from" above
  rm -rf /tmp/remotion-sparse
